﻿<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>SEO Site Audit: rounakneema.in — Oct 7, 2026</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#fff;--fg:#0a0a0a;--fg-2:#454545;--fg-3:#8f8f8f;--rule:#ebebeb;--rule-2:#dcdcdc;--sunk:#fafafa;
  --accent:#3b82f6}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);margin:0;padding:0 24px 120px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;letter-spacing:-.003em;
  font-family:Geist,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.shell{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
header{padding:40px 0 0;max-width:660px}
h1{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,56px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0;text-wrap:balance}
.byline{margin:24px 0 0;font-size:16px;color:var(--fg-2)}
.body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,660px) 1fr;gap:0 64px;margin:48px 0 0}
article{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;min-width:0}
.rail{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;font-size:14px;color:var(--fg-3);padding-top:6px}
.rail .sticky{position:sticky;top:40px}
.toc-label{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-3);margin:0 0 10px}
.toc ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.toc li{margin:0 0 7px}
.toc a{color:var(--fg-2);text-decoration:none}
.toc a:hover{color:var(--fg)}
@media (max-width:900px){.body{grid-template-columns:1fr}.rail{display:none}}
article p{margin:0 0 26px;text-wrap:pretty}
h2{font-size:30px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2;margin:60px 0 22px;text-wrap:balance}
h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:38px 0 14px}
.finding{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 26px}
.finding li{margin:0 0 8px;color:var(--fg-2)}
.finding b{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
a{color:var(--fg);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-color:var(--rule-2)}
strong{font-weight:600}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.86em;background:var(--sunk);border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px}
ul,ol{margin:0 0 26px;padding-left:22px}li{margin:0 0 11px}li::marker{color:var(--fg-3)}
.note{border-left:2px solid var(--fg);padding:2px 0 2px 22px;margin:0 0 26px}
.note p{margin:0;color:var(--fg-2)}
.note p+p{margin-top:14px}
.tw{overflow-x:auto;margin:0 0 30px}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15.5px;min-width:440px}
th{text-align:left;font-weight:500;color:var(--fg-3);padding:0 20px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-2);white-space:nowrap}
td{padding:13px 20px 13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top;color:var(--fg-2)}
td:first-child{color:var(--fg)}
td.n,th.n{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
td:last-child,th:last-child{padding-right:0}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
figure{margin:0 0 30px}
figcaption{font-size:14px;color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:8px}
.bars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(90px,170px) 1fr auto;gap:10px 12px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}
.bars .label{color:var(--fg-2);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.bars .track{display:block;height:20px;background:var(--sunk)}
.bars .bar{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent);opacity:.16}
.bars .value{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:3ch;text-align:right}
svg{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto}
hr{border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin:60px 0}
footer{max-width:660px;margin:64px 0 0;padding:26px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:15px;color:var(--fg-3)}
@media print{
  @page{margin:0 0 12mm 0;@bottom-center{content:counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:10px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#8f8f8f}}
  body{background:#fff;color:#111;padding:14mm 16mm 6mm;font-size:11pt}
  .shell,.body{display:block;max-width:none}
  header{padding:0;max-width:none}
  h1{font-size:26pt}
  h2{font-size:15pt;margin:22pt 0 10pt}
  h3{font-size:12pt;margin:14pt 0 6pt}
  article,footer{max-width:none}
  .rail{display:none}
  h1,h2,h3{break-after:avoid}
  table,figure,.note,svg{break-inside:avoid}
  tr,td,th{break-inside:avoid}
  p,li{orphans:3;widows:3}
  thead{display:table-header-group}
  .tw{overflow:visible}
  table{font-size:10pt;min-width:0}
  .byline,footer,figcaption{font-size:9.5pt}
  svg,.bars .bar,.bars .track{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}
  a{text-decoration:none}
}
</style></head>
<body><div class="shell">

<header>
  <h1>SEO Site Audit: rounakneema.in</h1>
  <p class="byline">Prepared for Rounak Neema · October 7, 2026</p>
</header>

<div class="body">
  <aside class="rail"><div class="sticky">
    <p class="toc-label">Contents</p>
    <nav class="toc" aria-label="Contents">
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#your-next-seo-move">Your next SEO move</a></li>
        <li><a href="#recommendations">Recommendations</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-else-we-checked">What else we checked</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-this-report-was-made">How this report was made</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
  </div></aside>
  <article>

    <h2 id="your-next-seo-move">Your next SEO move</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First action:</strong> Unify Next.js trailing slash routing rules across all subdomains to stop canonical bleeding (79 canonical and duplicate page warnings).</li>
      <li><strong>Next action:</strong> Deepen internal cross-linking to your technical blog posts and sub-projects to resolve the 14 orphan page warnings.</li>
      <li><strong>What's working:</strong> Your new technical blogs (e.g. Distroless Docker Go Apps) are already generating top-10 impressions in Google Search Console, and your AEO JSON-LD architecture is fully active.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="recommendations">Recommendations</h2>

    <h3>Fix Trailing Slash Duplication Site-Wide</h3>
    <p><strong>Do this</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Enforce a strict <code>trailingSlash: false</code> in your <code>next.config.ts</code> for the Blog, Portfolio, Web, and Project Sites.</li>
      <li>Implement a middleware or edge redirect that forces any URL ending in <code>/</code> to 301 redirect to its non-slash counterpart.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Why</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>The crawler found 21 canonicalized versions and 8 duplicate titles/descriptions. For example, <code>/blog</code>, <code>/blog/</code>, and <code>/blog/blog/</code> are all serving 200 OK responses simultaneously.</li>
      <li>Googlebot will waste crawl budget indexing duplicate pages, and search equity (link juice) splits across both variants.</li>
      <li><strong>Expected Effect:</strong> Consolidating URLs immediately fixes 37+ technical SEO errors and focuses your domain's ranking power on single canonical paths.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tw">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Duplicate Path Sample</th><th>Status</th><th>Recommended Fix</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>/blog/posts/distroless-docker-go-apps/</code></td><td>200 OK</td><td>301 Redirect to non-slash</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>/blog/blog/</code></td><td>200 OK</td><td>Remove recursive relative links</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>/projects/axiom-os/</code></td><td>200 OK</td><td>301 Redirect to non-slash</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3>Bridge Orphan Pages</h3>
    <p><strong>Do this</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Audit your sub-project <code>/docs</code> and <code>/architecture</code> subpages to ensure they are linked from the main project heroes or footers.</li>
      <li>Add a "Related Posts" component to your new blogs so they interlink with each other.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Why</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>The audit flagged 14 Orphan Pages. These are pages that exist on the server and in the sitemap but have zero internal links pointing to them.</li>
      <li>If a page has no internal links, crawlers assume it is unimportant, and users cannot organically discover it without knowing the URL.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="what-else-we-checked">What else we checked</h2>
    <div class="tw">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Opportunity</th><th>What we found</th><th>Decision</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Blog Keyword Visibility</td><td>Impressions for "distroless vs alpine", "axiom os", and "revealr" already surfacing in GSC (Positions 7–21) just days after publishing.</td><td>Let them bake. Write more posts in the DevSecOps cluster.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Meta Description Lengths</td><td>6 descriptions are marked too long (truncating in search).</td><td>Low priority. Google rewrites these dynamically anyway.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 id="how-this-report-was-made">How this report was made</h2>
    <p>Generated by the <a href="https://openseo.so/docs/skills/seo-audit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenSEO SEO Audit skill</a>, run by Antigravity on Oct 7, 2026.</p>
    <ul class="finding">
      <li><b>Tools:</b> <code>run_site_audit</code> from OpenSEO covered 35 unique paths. <code>get_search_analytics</code> from GSC pulled the last 28 days of queries.</li>
      <li><b>Verified:</b> The GSC query data matched the exact topics of the new blogs, proving instant indexing and surfacing.</li>
    </ul>

  </article>
</div>

<footer>Prepared with OpenSEO. Data as of October 7, 2026.</footer>
</div></body></html>
